, outfits, accesories, lamps and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the Monster:</i> Select the scariest skin to hunt all players down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/e449916a9802c67aa772ebd14eb7ded5.poster.avif?t=1756041243\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/e449916a9802c67aa772ebd14eb7ded5.webm?t=1756041243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/e449916a9802c67aa772ebd14eb7ded5.mp4?t=1756041243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new items by levelling up! (<i>You can also acquire them on the official Horror Night Store</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/89a4d7338194b32dd17fad6ea3dcd483.poster.avif?t=1756041243\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/89a4d7338194b32dd17fad6ea3dcd483.webm?t=1756041243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/89a4d7338194b32dd17fad6ea3dcd483.mp4?t=1756041243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Lobby</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting for your friends to join a match is no longer tedious ;) You'll be able to explore much more terrifying surroundings while doing so, and even speed up the game by simply pressing the new &quot;force start match&q